{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">港股反覆向好。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">恒指輕微低開後，很快止跌回升，最多升過170多點，上試24,900點水平。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">科網股帶動升勢，阿里巴巴及騰訊升百分之1，小米更升逾百分之3。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-21T05:58:11.122470+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":77,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}